### 3. Controller Layer

#### [MODIFY] [engine_controller.dart](file:///d:/PP942920DRIVE/PROJECTS/chess/app/lib/domain/engine/engine_controller.dart)
- Implement `getHumanoidMove(String fen, AIDifficulty difficulty, AIPersonality personality)`.
- Pipeline:
    1. Request Top N moves from Stockfish (MultiPV = 5).
    2. Pass candidates to `MoveSelector`.
    3. Calculate human-like thinking delay (300ms - 2000ms) based on position complexity.
    4. Return selected move.

